# All code commited to the repo uses LF, not CRLF
# Local can use either, but then the bash scripts
# don't work.
# @see .editorconfig, .vscode/settings.json, and configs/es/standard.json
# @see https://www.aleksandrhovhannisyan.com/blog/crlf-vs-lf-normalizing-line-endings-in-git/
# @see https://blog.boot.dev/clean-code/line-breaks-vs-code-lf-vs-crlf/
* text=auto eol=lf
